1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:02,564
ANKUSH: Smart girls fall for dumb boys.

2
00:00:02,484 --> 00:00:03,530
Explain that.

3
00:00:03,530 --> 00:00:04,340
PRIYA: First of all,

4
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:05,970
you're not helping your case.

5
00:00:05,970 --> 00:00:06,833
ANKUSH: Second of all…

6
00:00:06,753 --> 00:00:07,840
you're still here.

7
00:00:09,210 --> 00:00:10,728
PRIYA: Let's look at the evidence.

8
00:00:10,648 --> 00:00:11,260
Academics?

9
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:12,273
ANKUSH: Unfair.

10
00:00:12,193 --> 00:00:13,540
I haven't studied.

11
00:00:13,540 --> 00:00:14,740
PRIYA: That's the problem.

12
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:16,670
ANKUSH: Add handsome.

13
00:00:16,670 --> 00:00:18,690
PRIYA: This is a scientific evaluation.

14
00:00:18,690 --> 00:00:20,130
ANKUSH: Science has eyes.

15
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:22,244
PRIYA: I'm trying to finish an assignment.

16
00:00:22,164 --> 00:00:23,150
He sends me this.

17
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:26,680
ANKUSH: Caught!

18
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:27,840
PRIYA: It wasn't funny.

19
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:29,200
ANKUSH: Your nose disagrees.

20
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:30,170
PRIYA: Shut up.

21
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:31,235
PRIYA: Annoyingly,

22
00:00:31,155 --> 00:00:32,689
there's some science here.

23
00:00:32,609 --> 00:00:34,702
In a study of four hundred students,

24
00:00:34,622 --> 00:00:36,826
higher verbal and general intelligence

25
00:00:36,746 --> 00:00:38,559
went along with writing funnier

26
00:00:38,479 --> 00:00:39,510
cartoon captions.

27
00:00:39,510 --> 00:00:41,280
ANKUSH: So comedy is intelligence?

28
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:42,457
PRIYA: Not automatically.

29
00:00:42,377 --> 00:00:44,225
But a good joke takes timing,

30
00:00:44,145 --> 00:00:44,774
language,

31
00:00:44,694 --> 00:00:46,420
and unexpected connections.

32
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:47,930
ANKUSH: Like me.

33
00:00:47,930 --> 00:00:49,878
PRIYA: You are the unexpected twist.

34
00:00:49,798 --> 00:00:51,810
Not necessarily the punchline.

35
00:00:51,930 --> 00:00:53,456
PRIYA: Another experiment found that

36
00:00:53,376 --> 00:00:54,853
women preferred funny men as

37
00:00:54,773 --> 00:00:55,800
potential partners.

38
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:57,430
ANKUSH: I'm literally the data!

39
00:00:57,430 --> 00:00:59,610
PRIYA: You're one very noisy data point.

40
00:01:00,730 --> 00:01:01,825
PRIYA: Here's the thing.

41
00:01:01,745 --> 00:01:03,496
Being academically smart and

42
00:01:03,416 --> 00:01:05,526
being funny aren't the same skill.

43
00:01:05,446 --> 00:01:06,421
And apparently…

44
00:01:06,341 --> 00:01:08,212
I have a weakness for terrible

45
00:01:08,132 --> 00:01:08,570
jokes.

46
00:01:08,570 --> 00:01:10,280
ANKUSH: Speaking of terrible jokes…

47
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:11,970
ANKUSH: I'd tell you a chemistry joke,

48
00:01:11,890 --> 00:01:13,360
but I wouldn't get a reaction.

49
00:01:14,030 --> 00:01:14,870
ANKUSH: There are more.

50
00:01:15,390 --> 00:01:16,190
ANKUSH: Priya?!

51
00:01:16,190 --> 00:01:17,050
PRIYA: Give it back!

52
00:01:17,220 --> 00:01:18,630
ANKUSH: So you're not that different

53
00:01:18,550 --> 00:01:19,010
from me.

54
00:01:19,010 --> 00:01:20,300
PRIYA: Don't push your luck.

55
00:01:20,300 --> 00:01:21,660
ANKUSH: Then why am I still winning?

56
00:01:22,130 --> 00:01:23,600
PRIYA: I did not add that.

57
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:25,240
ANKUSH: Science has eyes.

58
00:01:25,760 --> 00:01:27,202
PRIYA: Maybe he's not as dumb as the

59
00:01:27,122 --> 00:01:28,000
report card says.

60
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:28,651
ANKUSH: Finally.

61
00:01:28,571 --> 00:01:30,150
Academic recognition.

62
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:31,333
PRIYA: Don't celebrate.

63
00:01:31,253 --> 00:01:33,540
You still can't spell Wednesday.
